# Onboarding path AS SHIPPED on this lane: there is no wizard — no config means every
# networked action shows the honest "Not configured / edit config.json on the card"
# message and NOTHING is dispatched. (The task-description wizard is a reported drift.)
desc app menu: no config -> honest "Not configured", no engine call
invoke app
config none
pick 0
pick 255
expect_exit 0
expect_trace PROMPT[Lodor]
expect_trace msg='Not configured
expect_trace App/LodorSync/data/config.json
expect_trace_absent ENGINE
